OL,3,ABurnham in Ukraine to hand over UK
OL,4,Ablueprints to make long-range missiles
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia and Ukraine are continuing to
OL,7,Ffire strikes at each other. Ukrainian
OL,8,Fauthorities say five people have been
OL,9,Fkilled in the Kharkiv region, while
OL,10,FRussia says three teenagers were killed
OL,11,Fwhen a children's centre was hit by
OL,12,F"drone debris"
OL,14,FKyiv has recently stepped up long-range
OL,15,Fattacks on Moscow and other Russian
OL,16,Fregions, targeting oil refineries and
OL,17,Fwarehouses
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
